{"name":"Lambskin","hex":"#ebdcca","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"lambskin","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The skin of a very young sheep, especially prepared with the fleece still attached. A very fine form of leather.","A kind of woollen cloth resembling this."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/lambskin"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sheepskin","blocks":[{"text":"Sheepskin is the hide of a sheep, sometimes also called lambskin. Unlike common leather, sheepskin is tanned with the fleece intact, as in a pelt."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Sheep_skin_for_sale.jpg/330px-Sheep_skin_for_sale.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sheepskin"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Sheep_skin_for_sale.jpg/500px-Sheep_skin_for_sale.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Sheep_skin_for_sale.jpg/500px-Sheep_skin_for_sale.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A whole sheepskin","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASheep_skin_for_sale.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/SuperUgg.JPG/500px-SuperUgg.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/SuperUgg.JPG/1280px-SuperUgg.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/SuperUgg.JPG/500px-SuperUgg.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Ugg boots are traditionally made from sheepskin.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASuperUgg.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/The_Battle_o